<title>USA: Paul Harris expands board to eight.</title>
<headline>Paul Harris expands board to eight.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paul Harris Stores Inc said on Tuesday that it elected James Morris as a director, increasing the company's board to eight members.</p>
<p>Morris is chairman and chief executive officer of IWC Resources Corp.</p>
<p>Paul Harris is a specialty retailer of private-label women's casual wear.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
